WHAT THE LICENCE COVERS

The software in this repository — packages/, services/, tools/, scripts/,
analysis/, migrations/ — together with the documentation in docs/.

WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER

  * GNSS observation data. Raw and processed observations are not distributed
    here; the file server is the system of record. Release of observation data
    is governed by agency data-release policy, and some of it belongs to other
    institutions — the PAGENET network is NAMRIA's, shared under a separate
    MOU/MOA.

  * Third-party software invoked by this code. Bernese GNSS Software (AIUB),
    teqc (UNAVCO), gfzrnx (GFZ) and RNXCMP each carry their own licences and
    are not redistributed here. gfzrnx in particular distinguishes free
    scientific use from operational pipeline use; see
    docs/project_documentation/gfzrnx_vs_teqc_rinex3_evidence.md.

  * packages/CORS-dashboard/, retained as forensic reference material rather
    than as work of this project.
